  "content": "UNITED STATES\nSECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION\nWashington, D.C. 20549\n\nFORM 10-K\nANNUAL REPORT PURSUANT TO SECTION 13 OR 15(d) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934\n\nFor the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023\n\nTesla, Inc.\nTicker Symbol: TSLA\n\nPART I\n\nItem 1. Business\nTesla, Inc. is a leading company in its industry sector.\n\nItem 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis\n\nFINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS FOR 2023:\nRevenue: $358,000 million\nOperating Income: $89,500 million  \nNet Income: $53,700 million\nTotal Assets: $895,000 million\n\nCONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME\n(In millions)\n\nYear Ended December 31, 2023\n\nRevenue                 $358,000\nCost of Revenue         $214,800\nGross Profit           $143,200\nOperating Income        $89,500\nNet Income             $53,700\n\nCONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEET\n(In millions)\n\nTotal Assets           $895,000\nTotal Liabilities      $358,000\nStockholders' Equity   $537,000"
